{"id":"00200","root":"uni00200_1","name":{"ja":"弓走　颯","en":"Yubashiri Hayate"},"title":{"ja":"【射止める花嫁】","en":"【Archery Bride】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【射止める花嫁】 弓走　颯","en":"【Archery Bride】 Yubashiri Hayate"},"element":"Natural","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-05-31","limited":true,"characterId":53,"profile":{"ja":"昔からある弓の名門・弓走家の跡取り娘。幼いころから弓の訓練を受けて育ったため、その腕はすでに達人の域。目視できる距離ならほぼ１００％の確率で標的に矢を当てることができ、さらに忍術・風遁の力で矢に風を纏わせることにより、弓の軌道を操り、殺傷能力を高めることもできる。厳しく育てられたためか、少し融通が利かず、冗談の通じない性格。本人もそれをどうにかしたいと日々精神鍛錬をしている。６月、ジューンブライドの季節がやってきた。五車学園の学生達にとってはまだ遠い先の話とはいえ、やはり女子にとってウェディングドレスは憧れ。ドレス特集を見て無邪気に盛り上がる同級生を横目に、颯は一人そわそわとしている。名家の跡取りである颯にはなにやら色々と事情があるのかもしれない……。","en":"(Yubashiri Hayate, she/her) She is the heir of the prestigious Yumisaki archery family, a lineage renowned for its bows. Trained from childhood, her skill already reaches master level—if a target is within sight, she can hit it with nearly 100 % accuracy, and by using ninja wind-style techniques she can wrap wind around her arrows to steer their trajectory and boost their lethality. Rigid from her strict upbringing, she struggles to go with the flow and often misses jokes, a flaw she works on daily through mental training. In June, the season of June Brides arrives. Though the wedding-dress dream feels distant to the Gosha Academy students, it still captivates the girls. While her classmates get excited over dress features, Hayate watches them with restless anticipation. As the heir of a noble house, there may be more to her situation than meets the eye…"},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"御苑生メイ","forms":[{"id":"uni00200_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[788,1576],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[120,240],"def":[86,172],"spd":[61,61],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","210009"]},{"id":"uni00200_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1176,2352],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[190,380],"def":[122,244],"spd":[61,61],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"sk