,1],[49,"blo00013",5],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00007",5],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00010",5],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00013",5],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"この弓走颯を、そう簡単に娶れると思うな？","en":"\"Don't think you can just take me, Yubashiri Hayate, so easily!\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"あ、あまりジロジロ見るんじゃない……どうせ、似合っていないんだろう？","en":"\"Ah, don't stare so much… you probably think it doesn't suit me, right?\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"このような格好でも、武で後れを取るつもりはない","en":"\"Even in this outfit, I won't fall behind in battle.\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"むぅ、やはりいつもの弓とは勝手が違うな……なんなのだ、このデザインは……","en":"\"Hmm, this bow is different from my usual one… what's with this design…\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"いつまでこの服を……いい加減、いつもの服に着替えたいのだが……","en":"\"How long am I supposed to wear this… I'd like to change back into my regular clothes already…\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"っっ……似合っているなどと、お世辞はいいっ……だが、その……ありがとう……","en":"\"…Stop flattering me saying I look good… but, um… thanks…\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"あ、あまりジロジロと見るな……くっ、こんな格好を見られるなど、武人の恥っ……","en":"\"Ah, don't stare… ugh, being seen in this outfit is a warrior's shame…\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"なに？　似合っている、だと……その、なんだ……悪い気は、しないが……うぅ……","en":"\"What? You say I look good… well, it's not a bad feeling… ugh…\""},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00200_1/uni00200_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[50],"scenes":[["chr_0126_r18"]],"stills":[